ountIf methods to GroupBy — 32 days old\\n  - [#7578](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7578) Add Melt method to DataFrame — 23 days old\\n\\n- **P0 Issue Open** — [#5805](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/5805) MKLImports PDB not included with packages (1,747 days old)\\n  - Priority: P0 (Critical)\\n  - No recent activity since 2021\\n\\n### Timely (🟡 Warning)\\n\\n- **52 unanswered questions >7 days old** — Many community members waiting for guidance. [View questions](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues?q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen+label%3Aquestion+sort%3Acreated-asc)\\n  - Oldest: [#181](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/181) Reinforcement learning (3,175 days old)\\n  - Many questions from 2017-2020 have never received maintainer responses\\n\\n- **6 stale PRs >90 days old** — Long-pending reviews may indicate unclear ownership or decision paralysis\\n\\n- **4 issues awaiting user input** — Should verify if users have responded:\\n  - [#7174](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/7174) Add AutoEncoder as Feature Selection Method (last comment by user Feb 24, 2025)\\n  - [#6045](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/6045) Long Column names unexpectedly dropped in training\\n  - [#6034](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/6034) Crashing in UWP Release, but not in Debug\\n  - [#5779](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/5779) object detection output float32[None,None2,13,13]\\n\\n- **1 open security issue** — [#3604](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/3604) Ensure documentation warns that models should be treated as code from security point of view (P3, 2,499 days old)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📬 Pending Community Interactions\\n\\n> Items where a community member is waiting for a maintainer response.\\n\\n| # | Title | Type | Author | Waiting Since | Last Activity |\\n|---|-------|------|--------|--------------|---------------|\\n| [#7174](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/issues/7174) | Add AutoEncoder as Feature Selection Method | Issue | superichmann | Jun 15, 2024 | Feb 24, 2025 |\\n| [#6449](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/6449) | Add DataViewSchema overloads to ConvertToOnnx | PR | FranklinWhale | Nov 12, 2022 | Nov 29, 2022 |\\n| [#7094](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7094) | Add support for Apache.Arrow.Types.Decimal128Type | PR | piyushdubey | Mar 21, 2024 | Dec 18, 2024 |\\n| [#7569](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7569) | fix: performance of erfinv | PR | JeWaVe | Jan 15, 2026 | Feb 06, 2026 |\\n| [#7575](https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7575) | Add CountDistinct and CountIf methods to GroupBy | PR | sevenzees | Jan 30, 2026 | Feb 12, 2026 |\\n\\n**Summary:** 5 awaiting response · 211 untriaged · 5 unreviewed PRs\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔧 CI / Workflow Health\\n\\n### GitHub Actions (7-day summary)\\n| Workflow | Runs | ✅ Pass | ❌ Fail | ⏹️ Cancel | Rate |\\n|----------|------|---------|---------|-----------|------|\\n| Various workflows | 8 | 8 | 0 | 0 | 100% |\\n\\n✅ **No failed runs in last 24 hours** — GitHub Actions health is excellent.\\n\\n### Azure DevOps Status (Heuristic)\\n- Open `blocking-clean-ci` issues: 0\\n- Open `Known Build Error` issues: 0\\n\\n✅ **CI appears healthy** — No open blocking or known build error issues.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🐛 Bug & Issue Landscape\\n\\n| Metric | Current | 7d Ago | Δ | Trend |\\n|--------|---------|--------|---|-------|\\n| Open issues (total) | ~211+ | N/A | — | First run |\\n| Open bugs | 0 | N/A | — | First run |\\n| Untriaged issues | 211 | N/A | — | First run |\\n| Open P0 | 1 | N/A | — | First run |\\n| Open P1 | 0 | N/A | — | First run |\\n| Issues opened (7d) | 0 | | | |\\n| Issues closed (7d) | 0 | | | |\\n\\n### High-Priority Bugs (P0/P1)\\n| # | Title | Priority | Assignee | Age (days) | Milestone |\\n|---|-------|----------|----------|------------|-----------|\\n| [#5805](https://github.com/dotnet